{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2666<strong>Weaponize fall damage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can weaponize catastrophic fall damage to active Anti-impact that blow away the enemies. If you success in landing, your energy to fight is stocked and you can attack again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u7740\u5730\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u653b\u6483.gif?t=1752402359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2666<strong>Mysterious dystopian world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story unfolds between 2D and 3D worlds. In this dystopian world, where an organization monopolize salt, People have tags implanted in their hearts and their thoughts are monitored constantly. You can\u2019t get salt because of your pacific principle there. Pick up trash in the garden, earn salt, survive in this harsh world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u30b7\u30e5\u30ac\u30fc\u3068\u306e\u4f1a\u8a71.gif?t=1752402359\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2666<strong>Get rid of bugging insects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange bugging insects live in the garden. Get rid of them disturbing your work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u866b\u3069\u3082.gif?t=1752402359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2666<strong>Parkour action in the randamly generated field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time the game starts, the field changes to test your improvisation skills. Run through, jump around, and land perfectly on the complex fields that are generated one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht